      "Title": "Development Practices",
      "GraphCollections": [
        {
          "Title": "How Structured Is the Work of Developers?",
          "Copy": "",
          "Graphs": [
            {
              "Title": "How Structured Is the Work of Developers?",
              "Copy": "We asked respondents if they use a schedule or spec to schedule and plan their work, and only 20% said their work closely aligns with such a planning doc. Those who adopt a more flexible approach or don't use any schedule or spec are more likely to have *more* years of professional coding experience; closely following a schedule or spec is associated with fewer years of experience.",
